Description:It is your first main phase. You are at 20 life and control Opalescence, then Humility (which entered after Opalescence), Sphere of Safety, Leyline of Sanctity, Ghostly Prison, Propaganda, 2 Plains and 5 Mountains, all untapped. Your hand is Flicker of Fate, Thud, Thud, Thud, Thud, Fling and Mountain. The opponent is at 33 life and controls an untapped Royal Assassin, a tapped Serra Angel and two untapped Swamps. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-niche-layers-humility | Humility and Opalescence both set base P/T in layer 7b and neither depends on the other, so the later timestamp wins (CR 613.4b, 613.7, 613.8): with Humility newer every creature is 1/1; Flicker of Fate gives Opalescence a new timestamp (CR 613.7, 400.7), so each enchantment becomes a creature of its mana value, still stripped of abilities by Humility in layer 6 (CR 613.1f), Royal Assassin's included; the Assassin chumps one attacker, every creature is then sacrificed for its power, Humility last so the Assassin never regains its ability: 19 - 5 + 19 = 33
